      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i’ve been dealing with those annoying kidney stones again (calcium oxalate ones, dr said) and i rly want to detox my system properly this time. i was thinking about taking like 2500mg of vitamin c every day to boost my immune system and clean things out, do u think that would help my kidney health or is it too much?",
